  "WL-4": "mv from DOMSnapshot tracked #box bounds delta; layout-shift outside the 500 ms input exclusion; UNCOVERED is CHANGED with mv null (AW6-04, AW6-09)",
  "WL-7": "pointer flag exact, rect derived; sub-tile 16 px < 32; runner passes --cursor-px 16 and x,y of each move from the prereg path (act.jsonl carries no x/y)"
 },
